{"speciesId":97,"names":{"fr":"Hypnomade","es":"Hypno","en":"Hypno","ja":"スリーパー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"When it locks eyes with an enemy, it will use a mix of PSI moves such as HYPNOSIS and CONFUSION."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"When it locks eyes with an enemy, it will use a mix of PSI moves such as HYPNOSIS and CONFUSION."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Avoid eye contact if you come across one. It will try to put you to sleep by using its pendulum."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"When it is very hungry, it puts humans it meets to sleep, then it feasts on their dreams."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Always holding a pendulum that it rocks at a steady rhythm, it causes drowsiness in any­ one nearby."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"The longer it swings its pendulum, the longer the effects of its hypnosis last."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"HYPNO holds a pendulum in its hand. The arcing movement and glitter of the pendulum lull the foe into a deep state of hypnosis. While this POKéMON searches for prey, it polishes the pendulum."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"HYPNO holds a pendulum in its hand. The arcing movement and glitter of the pendulum lull the foe into a deep state of hypnosis. While this POKéMON searches for prey, it polishes the pendulum."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"The arcing movement and glitter of the pendulum in a HYPNO’s hand lull the foe into deep hypnosis. While searching for prey, it polishes the pendulum."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It carries a pendulum-like device. There once was an incident in which it took away a child it hypnotized."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"When it locks eyes with an enemy, it will use a mix of PSI moves such as HYPNOSIS and CONFUSION."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Seeing its swinging pendulum can induce sleep in three seconds, even in someone who just woke up."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Seeing its swinging pendulum can induce sleep in three seconds, even in someone who just woke up."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Seeing its swinging pendulum can induce sleep in three seconds, even in someone who just woke up."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"When it is very hungry, it puts humans it meets to sleep, then it feasts on their dreams."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Always holding a pendulum that it swings at a steady rhythm, it causes drowsiness in anyone nearby."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"La vue de son pendule oscillant endort en trois secondes, même quand on vient de se réveiller."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Seeing its swinging pendulum can induce sleep in three seconds, even in someone who just woke up."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"La vue de son pendule oscillant endort en trois secondes, même quand on vient de se réveiller."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Seeing its swinging pendulum can induce sleep in three seconds, even in someone who just woke up."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Seeing its swinging pendulum can induce sleep in three seconds, even in someone who just woke up."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Seeing its swinging pendulum can induce sleep in three seconds, even in someone who just woke up."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il transporte toujours un petit pendule. On raconte qu’il aurait un jour enlevé un enfant après l’avoir hypnotisé."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Lleva un péndulo en la mano. Una vez, hizo desaparecer a un niño al que había hipnotizado."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It carries a pendulum-like device. There once was an incident in which it took away a child it hypnotized."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"振り子のようなものを 持ち歩く。 子供に 催眠術を かけて どこかへ 連れ去る 事件があった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"La vue de son pendule oscillant endort en trois secondes, même quand on vient de se réveiller."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Mirar su péndulo puede inducir al sueño en tres segundos, incluso si acabas de despertarte."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Seeing its swinging pendulum can induce sleep in three seconds, even in someone who just woke up."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"振り子を 目の前で ゆらされると たった今 目覚めたばかりの 人も ３秒後には 眠ってしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Hypnomade tient un pendule dans sa main. Le mouvement de balancier et les reflets brillants du pendule hypnotisent profondément son ennemi. Lorsque ce Pokémon cherche ses proies, il nettoie son pendule."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Hypno lleva un péndulo en la mano. El balanceo y el brillo que tiene sumen al rival en un estado de hipnosis profundo. Mientras busca a su presa, saca brillo al péndulo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Hypno holds a pendulum in its hand. The arcing movement and glitter of the pendulum lull the foe into a deep state of hypnosis. While this Pokémon searches for prey, it polishes the pendulum."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"手に 持っている 振り子 の 動きと 輝きが 相手を 深い 催眠状態に 落とす。 獲物を 探しながら 振り子を 磨いている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Hypnomade tient un pendule dans sa main. Le mouvement de balancier et les reflets brillants du pendule hypnotisent profondément son ennemi. Lorsque ce Pokémon cherche ses proies, il nettoie son pendule."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Hypno lleva un péndulo en la mano. El balanceo y el brillo que tiene sumen al rival en un estado de hipnosis profundo. Mientras busca a su presa, saca brillo al péndulo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Hypno holds a pendulum in its hand. The arcing movement and glitter of the pendulum lull the foe into a deep state of hypnosis. While this Pokémon searches for prey, it polishes the pendulum."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"手に 持っている 振り子 の 動きと 輝きが 相手を 深い 催眠状態に 落とす。 獲物を 探しながら 振り子を 磨いている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Bien que ce soit un Pokémon extrêmement dangereux, les personnes victimes d’insomnie le considèrent comme un sauveur."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Es un Pokémon muy peligroso, pero la gente que padece de insomnio lo considera su salvación."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"While it is an extremely dangerous Pokémon, people who are in need of a good, sound sleep call it their savior."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"非常に 危険な ポケモンだが 安眠を 求める 人々には 救世主と 呼ばれている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Quand il rencontre quelqu’un, il l’endort et goûte ses rêves. S’ils ont bon goût, il emporte la personne avec lui."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Cuando se encuentra a una persona, la duerme y posteriormente cata sus sueños. Si estos son de su agrado, la retiene consigo."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"As a matter of course, it makes anyone it meets fall asleep and has a taste of their dreams. Anyone having a good dream, it carries off."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"出会った者を 取りあえず 眠らせ その夢を 味見。 いい夢を 見ていたら そのまま 連れ去る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"À Alola, les Hypnomade s’en prennent principalement aux Dodoala. Les humains n’ont donc pas grand-chose à craindre."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"En Alola, los altercados con humanos son escasos, ya que el objetivo predilecto de los Hypno son los Komala."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"In Alola, Komala is Hypno’s main target. It rarely harms people."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"アローラに 暮らす スリーパーの ターゲットは 主に ネッコアラ。 人は あまり 被害に あわない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Certains Hypnomade travaillent comme assistants dans les cliniques visant à guérir les patients de leurs insomnies."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Este Pokémon presta ayuda al personal médico de los hospitales cuando algún paciente presenta dificultades para conciliar el sueño."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"There are some Hypno that assist doctors with patients who can’t sleep at night in hospitals."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"夜に 眠れない 人の ために 病院で お医者さんの 手伝いをする スリーパーも いる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Évitez son regard quand vous en croisez un, ou il pourrait essayer de vous hypnotiser avec son pendule."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Conviene evitar el contacto visual en caso de encontrarse con este Pokémon, ya que puede hipnotizar con su péndulo."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Avoid eye contact if you come across one. It will try to put you to sleep by using its pendulum."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"うっかり 出会ったときは 目を そらさないと 危険。手に もった 振り子で 眠らされてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Évitez son regard quand vous en croisez un, ou il pourrait essayer de vous hypnotiser avec son pendule."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Conviene evitar el contacto visual en caso de encontrarse con este Pokémon, ya que puede hipnotizar con su péndulo."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Avoid eye contact if you come across one. It will try to put you to sleep by using its pendulum."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"うっかり 出会ったときは 目を そらさないと 危険。手に もった 振り子で 眠らされてしまう。"}],"varieties":[{"id":97,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[1,"level-up",1],[2,"level-up",1],[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[19,"level-up",1],[23,"leve